Greetings, Champions!

We present a patch with an updated meta-progression. We've added more upgrade levels to many enhancements, adjusted prices, and introduced green coins to the endless arena. So, if you want to power up, the endless arena might be your go-to!

Additionally, we've added single-use enhancements to strengthen you in the next battle. We're continuously working on fixing bugs and balancing the game.

In the future, we plan to rework the hammer, as many find it less interesting compared to the spear. We hope the new version of the hammer will win your favor. We're striving to release this update as soon as possible.

Full list of changes:

[list]
[*] Meta-progression reworked;
[*] Achievement awarding bugs fixed;
[*] Ice block activation speed increased;
[*] Spirits and Valkyrie no longer collide with the player;
[*] Arena 2 slightly simplified, Arena 3 made harder;
[*] Numerous minor fixes.
[/list]

Hello everyone!

Today is a momentous day! Our game has finally been released in its full version. We've gathered a lot of feedback from players, watched streams, drawn conclusions, and now we present to you the release version.

What's new in the release version compared to early access:

- New element — Darkness;
- New character and rebalancing of existing ones;
- Improved balance of characters and enemies for more dynamic gameplay;
- Twitch integration — streamers can now play together with their audience;
- Final location;
- New bosses and enemies;
- Japanese language support;
- New cutscenes;
- New Steam achievements.

We invite you to dive into our game. We are confident that you will be satisfied!

We have prepared an exciting adventure for you in a colorful fantasy world. Epic battles with hordes of enemies and powerful bosses await you.

Game features:

- Unique immersive experience in picturesque, hand-drawn locations and engaging quests;
- Two game modes: story mode and endless arena;
- Global player leaderboard in "Endless Arena" mode;
- Over 70 unique character skills with impressive special effects;
- Numerous options for customizing characters and their abilities, making each playthrough unique.

Play now!

List of changes:

• Yarl has become stronger, faster, and more dangerous;
• Yarl's teleportation now occurs with the corresponding effect;
• Increased range of Hammer and Spear attacks;
• Yarl now respawns at the place of his death;
• Improved animations;
• Fixed weapon switching by click;
• New previews for quests;
• Returning spear now returns on its own;
• Killing Shadows no longer remain after passing the endless arena
• Armory's health upgrades now increases by 25%/50%/75% respectively
• Growth enhancement now gives 25% health increase, not 20% as before
• Fixed a bug when changing quality in settings
• New enemies now bleed their corresponding blood
• Fixed a bug with the arena on wave 76, as well as multiple smaller bug fixes

Enjoy the game, everyone! Leave your feedback and hurry up to buy the game while on sale!
